    <briefdescription>
<para>When <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_mach_o" kindref="compound">MachO</ref> binaries include a LC_CODE_SIGNATURE load command, the __LINKEDIT data segment will include a section corresponding to the LC_CODE_SIGNATURE load command. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This section serves as a signature for the binary. Included in the CodeSignature section is a header followed by a hash of the binary. If present, the CodeSignature section is the last component of the binary. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
